    "collapsible_content_B7H7eD": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "content_mXarDJ": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "title": "How many firearms can the FTK Maverick 6637 hold?",
            "content": "<p>The FTK Maverick 6637 is designed to store up to 48 firearms and includes adjustable shelving and a configurable interior, allowing you to organize long guns, handguns, ammunition, and other valuables efficiently.</p>",
            "content_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_x8TUQb": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "title": "What level of fire protection does the FTK Maverick 6637 provide?",
            "content": "<p>The safe features a reinforced 1-1/8\" fire door, fireboard insulation, and a heat-activated door seal. It is rated for up to 90 minutes of fire protection at temperatures reaching 1600°F.</p>",
            "content_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_jbAJcT": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "title": "What security features are included with the FTK Maverick 6637?",
            "content": "<p>The Maverick 6637 includes UL Residential Security Container (RSC) certification, 11-gauge steel body construction, a reinforced steel door, nine 1.5-inch locking bolts, a drill-resistant hard plate, and a UL-rated S&G Group II mechanical lock for enhanced protection against unauthorized access.</p>",
            "content_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_6zG6BA": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "title": "Does the FTK Maverick 6637 include power access inside the safe?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The safe comes with a factory-installed power outlet, allowing you to conveniently power accessories such as dehumidifiers, lighting systems, watch winders, and charging devices.</p>",
            "content_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_jUexQd": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "title": "What warranty comes with the FTK Maverick 6637?",
            "content": "<p>Fort Knox backs the Maverick 6637 with a lifetime factory warranty, demonstrating their commitment to long-term quality, craftsmanship, and customer support.</p>",
            "content_from_page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
